				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κένταυροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					79.5
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶγες</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.155
			</span></i> :—the Trag. form is <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρεσκόος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				532
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1277
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				247
			</span></i> ; also in <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lex.Mess.</u>
				p.409
			</span></i>.</div>
